---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About GPUCalc — Precision AI Hardware Sizing & Cloud Benchmarks"
  description="Learn about the engineering principles, mathematical modeling, and multi-cloud pricing engine powering GPUCalc."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12 py-4">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700/60 text-neutral-300 text-xs font-mono">
        <span>Engineering & Architecture</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        About GPUCalc
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Built for AI engineers, ML researchers, and infrastructure architects who need deterministic VRAM calculations and transparent cloud GPU pricing before spinning up expensive clusters.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/40 p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-200 font-mono font-bold text-xs">
          01
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100 text-base">Deterministic Formulas</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          We model PyTorch CUDA allocator behavior, including KV-cache expansion, GQA ratios, LoRA trainable weights, AdamW optimizer momentums, and runtime fragmentation headroom.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/40 p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-200 font-mono font-bold text-xs">
          02
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100 text-base">Multi-Cloud Pricing</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Aggregating verified spot and on-demand rates across RunPod, Lambda Labs, Vast.ai, AWS EC2, and GCP to ensure you never overpay for GPU compute.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/40 p-6 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700/60 flex items-center justify-center text-neutral-200 font-mono font-bold text-xs">
          03
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-neutral-100 text-base">100% Client-Side Privacy</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          All computations, configurations, and slider interactions execute strictly in your browser. No model weights, custom architectures, or telemetry data are collected.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Supported Hardware Architectures Section -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/40 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-white">
        Supported Hardware & Architectures
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-200">NVIDIA Blackwell (B200 / RTX 5090)</div>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Next-generation 192GB HBM3e and 32GB GDDR7 architecture with 2nd-gen Transformer Engine and native FP4/FP8 compute acceleration.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-200">NVIDIA Hopper (H100 / H200 SXM5)</div>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            The enterprise training and serving flagship with 80GB to 141GB HBM3 memory, NVLink-4 (900 GB/s), and FP8 Transformer Engine support.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-200">NVIDIA Ada Lovelace (RTX 4090 / L40S / RTX 6000)</div>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            The consumer and workstation champion with 24GB to 48GB GDDR6X, high memory bandwidth (1008 GB/s), and 4th-gen Tensor Cores.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-neutral-950 border border-neutral-800 space-y-1.5">
          <div class="font-semibold text-neutral-200">NVIDIA Ampere (A100 / RTX 3090 / A10G)</div>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Battle-tested high-VRAM data center standards supporting PCIe 4.0, NVLink-3, and TensorFloat-32 (TF32) precision.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Box -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/50 p-8 text-center space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Ready to Size Your Next Model Deployment?</h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Switch between presets, configure context length, test QLoRA adapters, and find the lowest cost cloud GPU in seconds.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-2">
        <a
          href="/#calculator"
          class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white hover:bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-950 font-semibold text-xs transition-colors"
        >
          Open VRAM Calculator
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-neutral-800 hover:bg-neutral-700 text-neutral-200 font-semibold text-xs border border-neutral-700 transition-colors"
        >
          Submit Hardware Benchmark
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
